--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ C's overrider in C's A: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ A's own in B's A: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ D and both A subobjects destroyed: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ again through the other path: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
